  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Ignoring notifications does not work like it does on the VRC website, which leads to visual clutter.\n\nOn the website, ignoring a notification will remove it from the notification list, requiring a click through to the Messages area if you wish to view the ignored notifs.\n\nOn the mobile app, ignoring a notification just marks it as ignored but leaves it in the list, making the list cluttered. In this way, the ignore function is almost useless.\n\n2023.4.2p2-1390-60fa9138c3-Release",
